%
% Package pgfplots
%
% Provides a user-friendly interface to create function plots (normal
% plots, semi-logplots and double-logplots).
% 
% It is based on Till Tantau's PGF package.
%
% Copyright 2007/2008/2009 by Christian FeuersÃ¤nger.
